# Self-contained Claude workspace — force-track the entire vendored .claude/ tree
# so a clone reproduces identical Claude behavior. Overrides generic ignores above
# (lib/, dist/, build/, *.log, etc.) that would otherwise drop vendored plugin files.
# settings.local.json stays ignored (machine-local) via the user's global gitignore.
!.claude/
!.claude/**
# ...except machine-local settings (re-ignore after the broad negation)
.claude/settings.local.json
